# =============================================================================
# FlowWeaver — environment file
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The supported environment template is deploy/.env.example. The deployment
# scripts (deploy/run.sh, deploy/run.ps1, deploy/setup.sh) read and write
# deploy/.env, not a .env file at the repository root.
#
#   cd deploy && cp .env.example .env
#
# See QUICK_START_GUIDE.md and deploy/README.md. Never commit a real .env.
# =============================================================================
